(AetherCorp Employee Handbook) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Document ID: HR-HB-2026-01) Tj
T*
(Effective date: 1 January 2026) Tj
T*
(Owner: People Operations) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(This handbook describes employment policies for all AetherCorp full-time, part-time, and) Tj
T*
(contract staff.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Paid time off) Tj
T*
(Full-time employees receive 20 days of paid time off \(PTO\) each calendar year. PTO accrues) Tj
T*
(at 1.67 days per month. Unused PTO may be carried over up to 5 days into the next year.) Tj
T*
(Contractors do not receive PTO unless specified in their statement of work.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Sick leave) Tj
T*
(Employees receive 10 sick days per year. Sick leave does not pay out at termination. A) Tj
T*
(doctor's note is required for absences longer than 3 consecutive working days.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Remote work) Tj
T*
(AetherCorp uses a hybrid model. Employees must be in a company office Tuesday through) Tj
T*
(Thursday. Monday and Friday are optional remote days. Exceptions require written approval) Tj
T*
(from a director. Core collaboration hours are 10:00 to 16:00 in the employee's local) Tj
T*
(timezone.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Parental leave) Tj
T*
(Primary caregivers receive 16 weeks of paid parental leave. Secondary caregivers receive 6) Tj
T*
(weeks. Leave may begin up to 2 weeks before the expected due date or adoption date.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Expenses) Tj
T*
(Travel and software expenses above 250 USD require pre-approval in the Nimbus expense) Tj
T*
(module. Meals during travel are capped at 75 USD per day.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Code of conduct) Tj
T*
(Harassment, discrimination, and retaliation are prohibited. Report incidents to) Tj
T*
(people@aethercorp.example or the anonymous ethics hotline 1-800-555-0199.) Tj
T*
ET
